er-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Bossier Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/bossier-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 151% of normal but November to December at 52%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 47% and June to July at 151%. On grid 15147 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 37.5, a figure from NOAA rain that RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ from.</p>"}
